  ┌ Keys ────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
  │Results                                               │
  │  enter    show the full image                        │
  │  j, down  move down                                  │
  │  k, up    move up                                    │
  │  g        top                                        │
  │  G        bottom                                     │
  │  ctrl-d   half a page down                           │
  │  ctrl-u   half a page up                             │
  │                                                      │
  │Anywhere                                              │
  │  ?          toggle help                              │
  │  /, 1       search                                   │
  │  2          focus the results                        │
  │  3          focus the art                            │
  │  4          focus the record                         │
  │  tab        next pane                                │
  │  shift-tab  previous pane                            │
  │  n          next artwork                             │
  │  p          previous artwork                         │
  │  space      show the full image                      │
  │  o          open on artic.edu                        │
  │  y          copy its link                            │
  │  f          filters                                  │
  │  s          cycle sort                               │
  │  A          more by this artist                      │
  │  D          more from this department                │
  │  R          surprise me                              │
  │  backspace  back to the previous list                │
  │  m          save or unsave                           │
  │  '          switch results and saved                 │
  │  e          edit its note                            │
  │  z          zen: art only                            │
  │  b          cycle art mode                           │
  │  r          pick a ramp                              │
  │  t          toggle timings                           │
  │  !          show the last failure                    │
  │  q          quit, after asking                       │
  │  ctrl-c     quit without asking                      │
  │  ctrl-z     suspend                                  │
  │  esc        close                                    │
